        "en": "this"
      },
      {
        "word": "arbeitet",
        "say": "AR-bye-tuht",
        "en": "works"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "title": "u is “oo” as in “moon”, short like “put”",
    "body": "Long u is the “oo” of “moon”; short u is the “u” of “put”. It is never the “u” of “cut” or “cute”.",
    "pattern": "(?<![aeäq])u",
    "examples": [
