  {
    "title": "ch after e, i, ä, ö, ü and consonants is a soft hiss",
    "body": "After other vowels, after ei, eu and consonants, and in -chen, ch is soft: put your tongue as for the “y” in “yes” and breathe out, like the “h” in “huge”. Don't make it “sh” or “k”.",
